## Estrutura de Pacotes — Backend

```
fake_miner/
├── bot/          # FakeMinerBot — comandos do Telegram
├── config/       # OshiConfig, TelegramConfig
├── controller/   # MetricasController — endpoints REST
├── model/        # MetricasHardware, StatusMineracao, EstadoAlerta
├── scheduler/    # ColetorMetricasTask, ResumoProgramadoTask
└── service/      # MonitoramentoHardwareService, MotorMineracaoService,
                  # AlertaService, TelegramNotificacaoService
```

## Estrutura de Pacotes — Frontend Mobile

```
lib/
├── bloc/         # MineradorBloc, MineradorEvent, MineradorState
├── core/         # ApiService
├── models/       # MineradorStateModel
├── screens/      # DashboardScreen, MineradorScreen, AlertasScreen
└── widgets/      # HashChart, MetricCard
```

